{"3799560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grimslair", "steam_appid": 3799560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your father is Grim, the Grim Reaper. To bring Isabella back from the dead, you must hunt monsters, tear power from their souls, and build a deck strong enough to defeat him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grimslair is a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder set in a hand-painted world that changes every run and grows deadlier each night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/04a8e78e74e91ac885654754c85bb2df.avif?t=1785267123\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras_big/04a8e78e74e91ac885654754c85bb2df.avif?t=1785267123 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE CARDS THAT SHOULD NOT EXIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Battle Cards let you build new cards from scratch. Soulwords ripped from fallen enemies reshape your cards with new damage, targeting, resource gains, status effects, and dangerous tradeoffs. Cards also level up as you use them, so the deck you start with is never the deck you finish with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK GRIM'S CHAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim deals enemy cards onto a five-slot chain. Connected cards can unleash multiple attacks and effects in a single turn. Play cards to charge your Chain Breaker, then shatter a connection before the full chain activates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, BARGAIN, OR KILL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run rearranges its paths, locations, enemies, and rewards. Cross graveyards, forests, caves, deserts, and frozen mountains as the clock races toward nightfall. Choose a safer route or risk deeper territory for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with strange vendors or kill them and take everything. Give souls to Grim for perks or keep them to unlock more Soulwords. When a choice goes wrong, Time Warp cards let you turn back the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT BESIDE YOUR DOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your husky fights with its own cards, abilities, and upgrades. Build its deck, strengthen its attacks, and turn your companion into a lethal part of your strategy. Yes, you can pet your dog!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140+ Battle Cards... Most Can Be Modified</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ Soulwords and Card Modifiers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Run-Changing Perks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Unique Enemies, Each with Special Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Unique Bosses</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every card, character, and piece of game art was hand-painted by the solo developer over nearly 6 years.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/3b4ea2dd70d2742365f20e5f304d4dbb.avif?t=1785267123\" width=1036 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content notice: dark fantasy violence, blood/gore, death, grief, and mild horror.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your father is Grim, the Grim Reaper. To bring Isabella back from the dead, you must hunt monsters, tear power from their souls, and build a deck strong enough to defeat him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grimslair is a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder set in a hand-painted world that changes every run and grows deadlier each night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/04a8e78e74e91ac885654754c85bb2df.avif?t=1785267123\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras_big/04a8e78e74e91ac885654754c85bb2df.avif?t=1785267123 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE CARDS THAT SHOULD NOT EXIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Battle Cards let you build new cards from scratch. Soulwords ripped from fallen enemies reshape your cards with new damage, targeting, resource gains, status effects, and dangerous tradeoffs. Cards also level up as you use them, so the deck you start with is never the deck you finish with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/41064abf409f63dc3e2b4a084c12704b.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK GRIM'S CHAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim deals enemy cards onto a five-slot chain. Connected cards can unleash multiple attacks and effects in a single turn. Play cards to charge your Chain Breaker, then shatter a connection before the full chain activates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b7ec840ecfb5fd701af0a08ea228c82.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, BARGAIN, OR KILL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run rearranges its paths, locations, enemies, and rewards. Cross graveyards, forests, caves, deserts, and frozen mountains as the clock races toward nightfall. Choose a safer route or risk deeper territory for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with strange vendors or kill them and take everything. Give souls to Grim for perks or keep them to unlock more Soulwords. When a choice goes wrong, Time Warp cards let you turn back the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0a02da3055c074b2a4ac2fe37d6ef709.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT BESIDE YOUR DOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your husky fights with its own cards, abilities, and upgrades. Build its deck, strengthen its attacks, and turn your companion into a lethal part of your strategy. Yes, you can pet your dog!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.poster.avif?t=1785267123\" width=660 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.webm?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c23e3abc452401e91d069e7621326df3.mp4?t=1785267123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140+ Battle Cards... Most Can Be Modified</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ Soulwords and Card Modifiers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Run-Changing Perks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Unique Enemies, Each with Special Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Unique Bosses</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every card, character, and piece of game art was hand-painted by the solo developer over nearly 6 years.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/3b4ea2dd70d2742365f20e5f304d4dbb.avif?t=1785267123\" width=1036 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content notice: dark fantasy violence, blood/gore, death, grief, and mild horror.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Rip Soulwords from fallen enemies and use them to create cards that should not exist. Fight beside your dog and rewind time in a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder, then challenge your father, the Grim Reaper, to bring your girlfriend back from the dead.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Here's another indie to not let fly under your radar next week!!”<br>Mega Crit - Slay the Spire Devs<br><br>“...Perfect for players who enjoy creative builds and tense strategic battles.”<br>10/10 – Hype Expert<br><br>“Great art and music and varied playstyles available, and with a promise of future content &amp; support - there's plenty here to keep you coming back for more!”<br>10/10 – These Are Interesting Times<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/2658840bc645c1f08640af20a223244c654b971f/header.jpg?t=1785267123", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/0b10d63ef94de9a8c7a8ba1fa969d7d3556f1c0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785267123", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st